{
  "source": "Prompts/learn-with-ai-1.mp4",
  "duration": 147.795,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.46,
      "text": "Between a history quiz tomorrow, an essay due Friday, a mountain of algebra homework plus"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.46,
      "end": 11.5,
      "text": "sports and family time, finding enough hours to actually study can feel impossible."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.54,
      "end": 16.34,
      "text": "The easiest solution would be to simply add four more hours to every day."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.94,
      "end": 21.88,
      "text": "Since we can't do that, artificial intelligence offers a realistic alternative to help you"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.88,
      "end": 25.32,
      "text": "get the work done, and genuinely make you sharper at the subject."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.08,
      "end": 28.92,
      "text": "Think of AI as the ultimate patient tutor."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.68,
      "end": 32.54,
      "text": "Unlike a human, an AI will quiz you at 1 a.m."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.88,
      "end": 37.9,
      "text": "It will never sigh when you ask a question for the third time, and it will always try a new"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.9,
      "end": 39.22,
      "text": "explanation when you get stuck."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.98,
      "end": 44.72,
      "text": "But to truly master the material, you have to move beyond just typing questions into a"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.72,
      "end": 45.62,
      "text": "general chatbot."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.02,
      "end": 49.18,
      "text": "You need to use AI tools built specifically for learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.94,
      "end": 54.06,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down using AI as a study tool versus a learning coach."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.7,
      "end": 58.64,
      "text": "On the left, Gemini Notebook keeps exam prep focused on assigned notes."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.36,
      "end": 63.18,
      "text": "On the right, your learning coach provides a step-by-step walkthrough when you're stuck"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.18,
      "end": 64.12,
      "text": "on a difficult concept."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.94,
      "end": 67.16,
      "text": "Check your materials if something doesn't line up."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.7,
      "end": 72.48,
      "text": "Gemini Notebook functions as a closed loop system, drawing answers exclusively from"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.48,
      "end": 73.26,
      "text": "provided sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.22,
      "end": 79.86,
      "text": "Under you upload, feed the system your specific materials, like PDFs, slides, or videos."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.86,
      "end": 85.84,
      "text": "In return, the you-get section outputs custom quizzes, flashcards, and study guides."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.42,
      "end": 89.12,
      "text": "It turns class materials into the study tools you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.02,
      "end": 91.58,
      "text": "Four moves for Gemini Notebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.32,
      "end": 94.26,
      "text": "One, keep one subject per notebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.18,
      "end": 97.24,
      "text": "Two, give it the full picture for context."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.14,
      "end": 100.3,
      "text": "Three, quiz yourself blind with this command."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.94,
      "end": 103.74,
      "text": "Generate a 10-question quiz from these sources only."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.4,
      "end": 105.28,
      "text": "Don't show the answers yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.8,
      "end": 107.08,
      "text": "Wait for mine, then grade me."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.64,
      "end": 109.8,
      "text": "Four, trace it back using citations."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.0,
      "end": 112.96,
      "text": "Sometimes you don't need another study guide."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.46,
      "end": 115.72,
      "text": "You need help understanding something that hasn't clicked."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.42,
      "end": 118.34,
      "text": "This is where you switch to the learning coach."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.12,
      "end": 121.14,
      "text": "You tell the AI exactly where you're stuck."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.68,
      "end": 126.24,
      "text": "You attempt to answer its guiding questions, ask for a hint when you hit a wall, and request"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.24,
      "end": 129.5,
      "text": "a completely different explanation if the first one doesn't make sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.36,
      "end": 131.1,
      "text": "You do the thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.54,
      "end": 133.36,
      "text": "AI helps you figure out your next step."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.36,
      "end": 137.1,
      "text": "This brings us to the final rule for using these tools effectively."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.12,
      "end": 140.7,
      "text": "Use AI to learn, not to skip the learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.44,
      "end": 141.48,
      "text": "Practice."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.24,
      "end": 142.56,
      "text": "Ask questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.42,
      "end": 143.8,
      "text": "Explain it yourself."
    }
  ],
